# U32: the unique DB (ItemDBControl "UNIQUE") of allflame_exp_001. Hover a row (the tooltip
# with dbMode); search "kaom" (the edit's changeFunc: listBuildFlag, the list builder
# coroutine, DoesItemMatchFilters); the slot filter to "Body Armour" and back to "Any slot";
# the sort dropdown to "Sort by Life" (SetSortMode, BuildSortOrder: the stat sort, calcFunc
# with repSlotName/repItem for every valid slot through the bridge); hover; drag row 1 onto the
# item list (ItemListControl:ReceiveDrag at its selDragIndex); Ctrl+click row 2 (add and equip
# in its primary slot); double-click row 3 (CreateDisplayItemFromRaw); drag row 1 onto the
# Boots slot (ItemSlotControl:CanReceiveDrag/ReceiveDrag).
#! u32-expect ^7slot nil db true
#! u32-expect Sort by Life
#! u32-expect Body Armour
#! u32-expect display: raw
